- Script steps reference

- About formulas');
INSERT INTO "script_step_sections" ("script_step_id", "locale", "position", "section_key", "heading", "body_text") VALUES (13, 'en', 0, 'ref-see-also', 'See also', '- Automating tasks with scripts');
INSERT INTO "script_step_sections" ("script_step_id", "locale", "position", "section_key", "heading", "body_text") VALUES (13, 'en', 1, 'ref-options', 'Options', 'None.');
INSERT INTO "script_step_sections" ("script_step_id", "locale", "position", "section_key", "heading", "body_text") VALUES (13, 'en', 2, 'ref-orig', 'Originated in version', '6.0 or earlier');
INSERT INTO "script_step_sections" ("script_step_id", "locale", "position", "section_key", "heading", "body_text") VALUES (13, 'en', 3, 'ref-desc', 'Description', 'Halt Script can leave your database in an unpredictable state. For example, the script might halt in an unanticipated layout, view, or mode.');
INSERT INTO "script_step_sections" ("script_step_id", "locale", "position", "section_key", "heading", "body_text") VALUES (13, 'en', 4, 'ref-example1', 'Example 1', 'Performs a find and prints. If no records are found, displays all records and halts the script.

Copy

Perform Find [Restore]
If [Get ( FoundCount ) = 0]
    Show All Records
    Halt Script
End If
Print [With dialog: Off]');
INSERT INTO "script_step_sections" ("script_step_id", "locale", "position", "section_key", "heading", "body_text") VALUES (13, 'en', 5, 'ref-examplen', 'Example 2', 'The Print Unpaid Invoices script calls the Print sub-script. If the user chooses not to print invoices, the script and sub-script stop. If the user chooses to print invoices, unpaid invoices that match the Find criteria are printed. After printing, all records are displayed and sorted.

Main script: Print Unpaid Invoices

Copy

New Window [Style: Document; Name: "Invoice List"; Using layout: "Print Invoices" (Invoices)]
Perform Find [Restore]
#Calls the "Print" sub-script defined below
Perform Script [Specified: From list ; "Print" ; Parameter: ]
#Continues after the sub-script is completed if the user chose to print the invoices
Show All Records
Sort Records [Restore; With dialog: Off]

Sub-script: Print

Copy

Show Custom Dialog ["Print Unpaid Invoices"; "Do you want to print unpaid invoices?"]
If [Get ( LastMessageChoice ) = 1]
    Print [With dialog: Off]
Else
    Close Window [Current Window]
    #Halts both the sub-script and the main script
    Halt Script
End If');
INSERT INTO "script_step_sections" ("script_step_id", "locale", "position", "section_key", "heading", "body_text") VALUES (13, 'en', 6, 'related', 'Related topics', '- Exit Script script step

- Script steps reference');
INSERT INTO "script_step_sections" ("script_step_id", "locale", "position", "section_key", "heading", "body_text") VALUES (14, 'en', 0, 'ref-see-also', 'See also', '- Automating tasks with scripts');
INSERT INTO "script_step_sections" ("script_step_id", "locale", "position", "section_key", "heading", "body_text") VALUES (14, 'en', 1, 'ref-options', 'Options', 'Specify the Boolean calculation you want evaluated.');
INSERT INTO "script_step_sections" ("script_step_id", "locale", "position", "section_key", "heading", "body_text") VALUES (14, 'en', 2, 'ref-orig', 'Originated in version', '6.0 or earlier');
INSERT INTO "script_step_sections" ("script_step_id", "locale", "position", "section_key", "heading", "body_text") VALUES (14, 'en', 3, 'ref-desc', 'Description', 'If the calculation result is any number except zero, the calculation evaluates to true and the subsequent script steps are executed. If the calculation result is zero, no data, or does not resolve into a number, then the calculation evaluates to false and the subsequent script steps are not executed.

Every If step must have a corresponding End If script step somewhere after the If step and at the same indentation. Whenever you use an If script step, the script editing pane automatically enters an End If step.

You can also add additional conditions by using the Else If script step and Else script step.');
INSERT INTO "script_step_sections" ("script_step_id", "locale", "position", "section_key", "heading", "body_text") VALUES (14, 'en', 4, 'notes', 'Notes', '- If you do not specify a calculation or if the calculation is unsuccessful, it will evaluate as false. Use the Get(LastError) function to capture these errors.');
INSERT INTO "script_step_sections" ("script_step_id", "locale", "position", "section_key", "heading", "body_text") VALUES (14, 'en', 5, 'ref-example1', 'Example 1', 'Performs a find. If no records are found, displays all records and sorts.

Copy

Perform Find [Restore]
If [Get (FoundCount) = 0]
    Show All Records
    Sort Records [Restore; With dialog: Off]
End If');
INSERT INTO "script_step_sections" ("script_step_id", "locale", "position", "section_key", "heading", "body_text") VALUES (14, 'en', 6, 'ref-examplen', 'Example 2', 'Performs a find. If no records are found, displays a custom dialog box. If records are found, sorts the found set.

Copy

Perform Find [Restore]
If [Get ( FoundCount ) = 0]
    Show Custom Dialog ["Find Records"; "No records were found."]
Else
    Sort Records [Restore; With dialog: Off]
End If');
INSERT INTO "script_step_sections" ("script_step_id", "locale", "position", "section_key", "heading", "body_text") VALUES (14, 'en', 7, 'ref-examplen', 'Example 3', 'Performs a find. If no records are found, displays a custom dialog box. If one record is found, goes to the Invoice Details layout. If more than one record is found, goes to the Invoices layout.

Copy

Perform Find [Restore]
If [Get (FoundCount) = 0]
    Show Custom Dialog ["Find Records"; "No record was found."]
Else If [Get (FoundCount) = 1]
    Go to Layout ["Invoice Details"]
Else
    Go to Layout ["Invoices"]
End If');
INSERT INTO "script_step_sections" ("script_step_id", "locale", "position", "section_key", "heading", "body_text") VALUES (14, 'en', 8, 'ref-examplen', 'Example 4', 'Performs a find. If no records are found, displays a custom dialog box so the user can run the Find Invoices script to search again. If one record is found, goes to the Invoice Details layout. If more than one record is found, goes to the Invoices layout.

Script: Find Invoices

Copy

Perform Find [ ]
If [Get ( FoundCount ) = 0]
    Show Custom Dialog ["No Record Found"; "No records were found. Do you want to search again?"]
    If [Get ( LastMessageChoice ) = 1]
        #Calls this script again as a sub-script
        Perform Script [Specified: From list; "Find Invoices" ; Parameter: ]
    Else
        Show All Records
    End If
Else If [Get ( FoundCount ) = 1]
    Go to Layout ["Invoice Details"]
Else
    Go to Layout ["Invoices"]
End If
Sort Records [Restore; With dialog: Off]');
INSERT INTO "script_step_sections" ("script_step_id", "locale", "position", "section_key", "heading", "body_text") VALUES (14, 'en', 9, 'related', 'Related topics', '- Defining calculation fields

