INSERT INTO "script_step_sections" ("script_step_id", "locale", "position", "section_key", "heading", "body_text") VALUES (44, 'en', 1, 'ref-options', 'Options', '-
Select entire contents deletes the contents of a field in the current record and saves it to the Clipboard. If you do not use Select entire contents, only the selected portion of the field''s data is cut.

